            "title": "Trump Calls for 10% Cap on Credit-Card Interest Rates",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "President  Trump  called for credit-card interest rates to be capped at 10% for one year in his latest attempt to address voter concern about the stubbornly high cost of living.  \u201cPlease be informed that we will no longer let the American Public be \u2018ripped off\u2019 by Credit Card Companies that are charging Interest Rates of 20 to 30%, and even more,\u201d the president posted Friday on social media, adding that he wants the cap to begin Jan. 20.  Trump proposed a 10% cap during the 2024 presidential campaign as a way to ease the burden on Americans who are carrying high levels of credit-card debt.",
